   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Politics of evidence conference big push forward</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">konferens IDS Evidensagenda</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Inatsen &#xe4;r inte en insats i egentlig mening utan inneb&#xe4;r att Sida     deltar i finansieringen av en konferens arrangerad av IDS i UK.       Konferensen syftar till att utforska eveidensagenda och hur den       p&#xe5;verkar v&#xe5;ra samarbetspartners/genomf&#xf6;rare n&#xe4;r de arbetar med        tranformativ utveckling.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This is not an intervention per se but support to conference which    aims at exploring the Evidence agenda and how it affects our partners when working with transformational development. Sida has a            long-standing relationship with IDS which has generated positive      outcomes in the past. If Sida is to become even more of an agency     providing expertise within the field of international development we</narrative>
  </description>
